Rule 6 (input tensors must have same size at non-singleton dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 7 (output tensor must be of correct type for hypot operation)
